<title>BRAZIL: Brazil non-ferrous metals - August statistics.</title>
<headline>Brazil non-ferrous metals - August statistics.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Production in August and consumption, imports and exports of Brazilian non-ferrous metals in January/August compared to 1995 were as follows, according to Secretariat of Mines and Metallurgy.</p>
<p>All figures are in tonnes.</p>
<p>    METAL	    PRODUCTION (AUG)     CONSUMPTION (JAN/AUG)</p>
<p>			  1996	 1995	    1996	 1995</p>
<p> Aluminium	  101,700    101,300	 378,469    349,904</p>
<p> Lead			 0	1,538	     n/a     51,700</p>
<p> Copper		15,674     15,279	 146,454    144,696</p>
<p> Tin		    1,322	1,550	   4,410	3,522</p>
<p> Magnesium		n/a	  n/a	     n/a	  n/a</p>
<p> Nickel		 1,390	1,230	  13,398     12,656</p>
<p> Zinc		  14,167     16,585	  91,034    131,331</p>
<p>METAL		   EXPORTS (JAN/AUG)	IMPORTS (JAN/AUG)</p>
<p>			  1996	 1995	    1996	 1995</p>
<p> Aluminium	  497,292    523,020	  54,457     74,899</p>
<p> Lead		   1,511	2,405	  20,879     41,095</p>
<p> Copper		47,523     36,257     1,059,199    121,308</p>
<p> Tin		    7,280	6,334		32	  156</p>
<p> Magnesium	    1,294	   64	   1,317	1,824</p>
<p> Nickel		 3,891	3,206	   6,854	5,212</p>
<p> Zinc		  35,143     27,515	   5,009     31,836</p>
<p>--Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
